      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `4c9b6b414846bda2820571dadb8e77e59027d49dafc028467e2f99b5eb9585c7--prisoners-australia-2012-cube-2-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Prisoners in Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2012\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 12 of 12\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 76a56dbca3c30486d126af7fceff54e2524e0be077e2a1b2b4d22e586f0a029b | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 21242193ba71100a125727f7fca1f65fec8c9c5c6d5221b34e4cef51f26db350 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | c7bce353b36e0443c699bb126411e7fba66dc9f8b7372fb2a453f595a4bde3ba | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 9bf11c7af6bcb28afd3e9e1b06c55738e986ad2fb6f400aac385cfc0692405be | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 5d98b85b82c82cabf62a47be3dfb86c69bbbdae273ee40c8a7ed083906fbaa17 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 689ee41a197f877d62ed8674383714fe8bc9a8c379c5611597130ff7c567064e | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 1d58ac9fa5c7cd4cea411aea1646b103cad00af37db63c7c956e0305083d3229 | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | 25577e1dfa37932702e4d60dca548ba910842b241b70874ae7b05684a5ad7900 | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | c31b41b70c8131502939c6ceed826eef9741c1b013c97ac6619145c274d004dc | missing |\n| \"Table_9\" | b5e3460b750f711feef5e83659e13c80b71439a0f3c29ac93ae36775aa9a2284 | missing |\n| \"Table_10\" | 0f8dbfc95dea3bf7a24400acc124d73c0c16b9dad96eec0b06d95becdb33c6ae | missing |\n| \"Table_11\" | f21be1216365f840e236408baf7a942192968e9dbe8e2a764b2287f82db5d285 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\